    "mart_absolute_fpr_caveat_fix": "temporal single-run split makes MART (and every single-clean-run control) calibrate & evaluate on DISJOINT halves of its own run: control_sites_with_cal_hold_overlap==0 under the temporal split (vs 1 under interleave), so the pooled held-out FPR denominator is fully out-of-sample. Pareto verdict identical under both splits."
